+  Dynamic fields:  {{club_name}} {{club_initials}} {{replier_name}} {{replier_initials}}
+                   {{conversation_subject}} {{reply_body}} {{conversation_url}}
+                   {{recipient_email}} {{follow_reason}} {{stop_following_url}}
+                   quoted_history[] (most-recent-first, nested): {author, sent_label, body}
+  Subject:   Re: {{conversation_subject}}
+  From:      {{club_name}} via Memba <kootenay-alpine@memba.io>
+  Reply-To:  kootenay-alpine+c.<token>@clubs.memba.io     (conversation address — iteration 041)
+  Headers:   Message-ID, In-Reply-To, References set so clients thread + fold (iteration 041)
